SUMMARY:Wandering Dance Festival
LOCATION:Colonial Theatre\, 111 South St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Discover the joy of movement as the Wandering Dance Festival re
 turns to downtown Pittsfield for its fourth year. Developed and sponsored 
