SUMMARY:On the Calculation of Volume (Book I) by Solvej Balle
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:Book Talk with Lizzie Whitman\n“How on earth did this book co
 me into being? It’s like it has always been here in this world with us\,
  like one feels about the best art. I am torn as I read it between lingeri
 ng and racing ahead\, and I think about my days completely differently now
 .” — Sheila Heti Lizzie Whitman convenes this casual book club around 
 Solvej Balle’s utterly riveting On the Calculation of Volume (Book I) 
 — the grand opening of her speculative fiction septology\, winner of the
  2022 Nordic Council Literature Prize (Scandinavia’s most important lite
 rary award) for being “a masterpiece of its time.” Balle was also nomi
 nated for the International Booker Prize and a National Book Award for thi
 s book.\nhttps://massmoca.org/event/lizzie-whitman-on-on-the-calculation-o
 f-volume-book-i/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernm
 a/
URL:https://massmoca.org/event/lizzie-whitman-on-on-the-calculation-of-volu
 me-book-i/
END:VEVENT
