SUMMARY:Albany Berkshire Ballet Presents: The Nutcracker
LOCATION:Colonial Theatre\, 111 South St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 2pm\, 6pm\nCelebrate the magic of the holiday season as 
 Albany Berkshire Ballet (ABB) returns with its annual tour of The Nutcrack
 er. Choreographed by ABB’s Artistic Director Madeline Cantarella Culpo\,
  this beloved production features lavish sets and scenery by Stockbridge n
 ative and renowned theatre and film set designer Carl Sprague\, with costu
 mes by Sam Meredith. Young local dance students join professional ABB danc
 ers in special children’s roles\, sharing the stage with a company of pe
 rformers from across the United States and around the world.\nhttps://www.
 berkshiretheatregroup.org/event/albany-berkshire-ballet-presents-the-nutcr
 acker/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.berkshiretheatregroup.org/event/albany-berkshire-ballet-pre
 sents-the-nutcracker/
END:VEVENT
